CustomRPCPlus

Originally derived from CustomRPC in Equicord:
https://github.com/Equicord/Equicord/tree/8d63e9694b2ef5195806b3f8b2e03135a4b4ea2c/src/plugins/customRPC

Copyright (c) 2023 Vendicated and contributors.
Original plugin credits retained: captain, AutumnVN, nin0dev, c0nnorgg.

Modified on 2026-11-26:
The first standalone Plus implementation was replaced with a small add-on for
the original CustomRPC. It adds Default, PlayStation and Xbox selection to the
original editor and changes only the platform on the original outgoing event.
The original CustomRPC source, settings, sender, timers and presets are retained.
Integration tests bundle the real original plugin with mocked Discord services.

The preview now follows the selected platform while preserving the original
preview content. Its original rendering is restored when the add-on is disabled.
The CustomRPCPlus plugin author metadata lists only Discord account
801514233010847784. Upstream attribution remains in this notice and source headers.

Optional native game profile linking was added to the editor and preview.
It changes the outgoing game application ID and preserves custom artwork paths
while omitting conflicting image click URLs. The user's requested initial target
is the GTA VI game page, application ID 1445160676522856458.
Configured artwork is retained. When the large image is empty, the linked game's
Discord application icon is used when available, in both the sender and preview.

Status display type selection was added to the editor, sender and preview.
Original presets now include the Plus platform, game profile and status display
settings as namespaced serialized metadata. Older presets remain usable.

Vencord and Equicord compatibility was added. The add-on now owns a Complete
Presets editor and storage format, with migration from earlier preset records.
Stock Vencord receives the repeating custom timestamp behavior from the add-on;
the user's Equicord build retains its native timer. Client source files are kept
unchanged. Upstream Vencord source was inspected at revision
d086992fb674299a2fa05ac6432edc3a777389f3.

